# Exact shared Q14 two-pole recurrence, retaining the compact voice ordering.
# This arithmetic seam does not admit a filter profile or prove pole stability.
# Its caller owns typed controls, coefficient projection, state and work bounds.
plot dsp/resonator-recurrence (
    item: type
    output: type
    >> value: item
    result: output >>
) = ((.drive + .b * .y1 + .c * .y2) / 16384)
